[PrintTextModified Text:啊……|#0104Adv01_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊艾玛亲，你还活着呀。<br>好顽强的生命力。|#0104Adv01_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:倒不如说你死了就要开审判找魔女了啊。<br>你就尽管挣扎，多活一天是一天吧。|#0104Adv01_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。|#0104Adv01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:拜啦。|#0104Adv01_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:身体的疲惫，内心的恐惧。<br>这一切让少女移开了视线。|#0104Adv01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
