@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:让我们苟且活着的目的究竟是什么呢。|#0104Adv01_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然一辈子都没打算放我们走，<br>倒不如干脆点，把我们都杀了算了。|#0104Adv01_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这简直就是折磨。就是在温水煮青蛙。|#0104Adv01_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0104Adv01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:对自己仍活在世上的感觉早已磨灭，<br>少女怀抱着空虚感，有如梦呓一般轻声说道。|#0104Adv01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

