[PrintTextModified Text:好安静啊……|#0104Adv01_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:早些时候明明还很热闹，<br>但现在这样……感觉真是凄凉。|#0104Adv01_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……|#0104Adv01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:回想着那段无法挽回的时光，<br>少女在感到宽慰的同时，眼泪也缓缓流下。|#0104Adv01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

