[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛小姐，我们要不去散散步？|#0104Adv01_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是一时的起意，<br>梅露露站起来说道。|#0104Adv01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:散步？去哪里散步？|#0104Adv01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:这个……哪里都行。<br>我只是觉得，要是一直哭丧着脸，<br>肯定会被雪莉小姐和汉娜小姐责骂。|#0104Adv01_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我们不能认输，得打起精神来才行。|#0104Adv01_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:带着红肿的双眼，<br>梅露露打起精神笑了笑。|#0104Adv01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:说、说得对……我不想认输。<br>我们还活着，还能继续努力。|#0104Adv01_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……我们走吧，艾玛小姐！|#0104Adv01_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
