[PrintTextModified Text:……话虽如此，<br>在这座监牢内，她们能去的地方十分有限。|#0104Adv01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和梅露露手牵着手，<br>踏上楼梯往楼上的娱乐室走去。|#0104Adv01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我们要尽情地玩一顿，<br>尽情地笑一顿，这样肯定就能打起精神来。|#0104Adv01_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我呢，希望大家都能一直充满活力。<br>希望大家都能一直笑着，一直阳光地活着。|#0104Adv01_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……我们玩什么好呢。|#0104Adv01_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我看看……我也没怎么跟别人一起玩过。<br>但、但不管怎样！我们要大闹一番！|#0104Adv01_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着莫名兴奋起来的梅露露，<br>艾玛不由得满面春风起来。|#0104Adv01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:都还没开始就想着大闹一番啊？|#0104Adv01_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是的……不可以吗？|#0104Adv01_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:当然可以，就按你说的，<br>我们今天绝对要玩一个闹翻天！|#0104Adv01_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到这句话，梅露露笑着点了点头，<br>抢先踏上了一级台阶。|#0104Adv01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛看着她的背影向她说道。|#0104Adv01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:还好有梅露露在。|#0104Adv01_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们要一直在一起哦。|#0104Adv01_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（不要丢下我一个人）|#0104Adv01_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……！|#0104Adv01_Meruru011| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这是此时此地唯一确定的事物。|#0104Adv01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:掌心传来的温暖<br>此刻成为了艾玛的救赎。|#0104Adv01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

