[PrintTextModified Text:——又过了几天。<br>艾玛今天也跟前几天一样，<br>漫无目的地到处闲逛。|#0104Adv01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一成不变的日子一天天过去。时间一长，<br>竟让人觉得这种日常其实还算安稳。|#0104Adv01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，艾玛听到一阵翅膀拍动的声音，<br>吓得摆起了架势。|#0104Adv01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来是典狱长飞来了。<br>它看到艾玛后，驻足留在了原地。|#0104Adv01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，这不是樱羽艾玛小姐嘛。<br>最近日子这么和平，真是万幸。|#0104Adv01_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0104Adv01_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要在监牢或室外到处走动，<br>偶尔会像这样遇到典狱长。|#0104Adv01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但它既不是会让人想要闲谈几句的对象，<br>艾玛也不清楚应不应该憎恨它。|#0104Adv01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说到底，典狱长不过是在履行自己的职务，<br>做好运营监牢的工作而已。|#0104Adv01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:唯一的问题是处刑台的状态不太好，<br>其实上次处刑时就已经这样……|#0104Adv01_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经安排了，明天下午<br>得认真地做一次检修。忙死了……|#0104Adv01_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不自觉地把视线转向过道前方的审判庭。<br>平常一直关得紧紧的大门现在却是打开的。|#0104Adv01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来典狱长就是因为来回进出审判庭<br>才会到处飞来飞去。|#0104Adv01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:这座监牢也已经十分破旧了，<br>真希望能给我多招几个勤快的员工呢……<br>真会使唤鸟啊……|#0104Adv01_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:发了几句牢骚以后，<br>典狱长马上又飞走了。|#0104Adv01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆詰めていた息を吐き出す

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0104Adv01_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛来到窗边，轻轻地叹了一口气。<br>为了转换一下心情，她注视着彩绘玻璃外的景色。|#0104Adv01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:晚餐时间还没到，<br>但天色却已经变得相当昏暗。|#0104Adv01_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（把我们关在监牢里<br>　到底有什么目的……<br>　这问题就算问了，估计它们也不会回答吧）|#0104Adv01_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（果然它们是在等所有人都变成魔女吗）|#0104Adv01_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那就是迟早的事了……<br>　被关在这种地方，大家迟早都会变成魔女……）|#0104Adv01_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是艾玛心里一直觉得哪里不对劲。|#0104Adv01_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我真的是魔女吗？）|#0104Adv01_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为什么只有我不能用魔法）|#0104Adv01_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果我不是魔女的话，<br>　那最后只会剩下我一个人活着……？）|#0104Adv01_Ema020|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛伸手摸进口袋，<br>如同抓住护身符一般握紧里面的钢笔。|#0104Adv01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我不要孤零零一个人……）|#0104Adv01_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在艾玛带着泫然欲泣的心绪望着窗外时，<br>视野里突然纷纷扬扬地落下点点白色。|#0104Adv01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？|#0104Adv01_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那些从暗淡的夜空中静静地飘扬而下的东西，<br>从方向看来，应该落在了湖的附近。|#0104Adv01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在艾玛的认知里，现在应该是春天才对。<br>眼前梦幻而荒诞的景象让她看得出了神。|#0104Adv01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:雪……|#0104Adv01_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

